gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "ANAHI: Sorry to keep you waiting.\p"
	.string "Welcome to ARAUNA.\p"
	.string "My name is ANAHI.\p"
	.string "I am a field researcher.\p"
	.string "I study POKéMON, memory and BONDS.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is a POKéMON.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "People and POKéMON live side by side all\n"
	.string "over ARAUNA.\p"
	.string "We work, we travel, and we form BONDS.\p"
	.string "But some of those BONDS are failing.\p"
	.string "POKéMON forget places, voices, even the\n"
	.string "person who walked beside them.\p"
	.string "We call it DISENCHANTMENT.\p"
	.string "I am trying to understand what is\n"
	.string "happening.\p"
	.string "Perhaps your journey will find answers\n"
	.string "my lab has not.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you, who are you?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy? Or a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "What is your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So you're {PLAYER}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "I see.\p"
	.string "You're {PLAYER}, the one moving to\n"
	.string "VILA AMANHECER.\p"
	.string "That makes sense now.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Right. Are you ready?\p"
	.string "Your journey through ARAUNA starts\n"
	.string "now.\p"
	.string "Watch the POKéMON. Listen to the\n"
	.string "people.\p"
	.string "Memory is not a piece of data with no\n"
	.string "owner.\p"
	.string "When you reach VILA AMANHECER, look\n"
	.string "for my lab.\p"
	.string "$"
